TI  - Lessons learned from stock collapse and recovery of North Sea herring: A review
AU  - Dickey-Collas, M.
AU  - Nash, R.D.M.
AU  - Brunel, T.
AU  - Van Damme, C.J.G.
AU  - Marshall, C.T.
AU  - Payne, M.R.
