TI  - On the use of large-scale biodegradable artificial reefs for intertidal foreshore stabilization
AU  - Marin-Diaz, B.
AU  - Fivash, G.S.
AU  - Nauta, J.
AU  - Temmink, R.J.M.
AU  - Hijner, N.
