TI  - Knowledge to decision in dynamic seas: Methods to incorporate non-indigenous species into cumulative impact assessments for maritime spatial planning
AU  - Liversage, K.
AU  - Kotta, J.
AU  - Aps, R.
AU  - Fetissov, M.
AU  - Nurkse, K.
AU  - Orav-Kotta, H.
