TI  - Converting beach wrack into a resource as a challenge for the Baltic Sea (an overview)
AU  - Chubarenko, B.
AU  - Woelfel, J.
AU  - Hofmann, J.
AU  - Aldag, S.
AU  - Beldowski, J.
AU  - Burlakovs, J.
